---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Talks & Teaching">
  <section class="container page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Learning, together</p>
    <h1>
      Make knowledge
      <br />
      travel<span class="accent">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p>
      Conversations, practical demonstrations and classroom sessions that
      connect engineering ideas to everyday work.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="container section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">On stage</p>
        <h2>Your tests are lying to you.</h2>
      </div>
      <span class="small-label">API Hour #72 · Clermont’ech · June 2026</span>
    </div>
    <div class="two-columns">
      <p class="lead">
        A practical introduction to mutation testing: what happens when we
        deliberately change production code to find out whether our tests
        notice?
      </p>
      <div>
        <p>
          The talk explores the gap between executing code and checking its
          behavior, and how mutation testing can make that gap visible.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a
            class="text-link"
            href="https://www.clermontech.org/talks/api-hour-72/romain-rochegude-mutation-testing-quand-vos-tests-sont-mis-a-lepreuve.html"
            hreflang="fr"
          >Official talk page (in French) ↗</a>
          <a
            class="text-link"
            href="https://noti.st/romain-rochegude/P4T8gB"
          >View slides ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="slides-embed">
      <iframe
        src="https://noti.st/romain-rochegude/P4T8gB/embed"
        title="Your tests are lying to you: A practical introduction to mutation testing — slides"
        width="960"
        height="540"
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        allowfullscreen
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container section">
    <p class="eyebrow">In the classroom / 2025–2026</p>
    <div class="two-columns">
      <div>
        <h2>
          Teaching the next
          <br />
          generation of engineers.
        </h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Software Architecture & Quality
          <br />
          ISIMA — Clermont Auvergne INP
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          Lectures and practical labs for second-year engineering students,
          connecting design principles with working code.
        </p>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li>Object-oriented design, SOLID and design patterns</li>
          <li>DDD, hexagonal architecture and event-driven systems</li>
          <li>Testing with TDD and BDD</li>
          <li>Java, Spring Boot, Kafka and delivery automation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
